                                        augeasproviders_ssh 7.0.0

Do not edit: TestAugeasFixturesMatchManifests (internal/units) requires each
file's sha256 to equal the digest in ../manifest.go. The unit's route also lists
augeasproviders_core's three files; they are in that unit's testdata/lib.

augeas/traces/ holds the ssh_config (02*), sshd_config (03*), sshd_config_subsystem
(04*) and SIMP-lens (07*) cases: every libaugeas call openvox 8.33.0 made to
libaugeas 1.15.0 while applying the case's catalog, recorded by an LD_PRELOAD
interposer (see tests/spine/augeas/trace/). Do not edit: the providers' call
sequences are asserted equal to them. Re-record a case instead.
